              "narration": "The first rendering layer is A-Frame, a declarative WebXR framework. Public entities from Wikidata become primitives in a 3D scene. The canvas is functional but abstract — labels on geometric shapes. Spatial layout begins to suggest that geometry alone cannot carry meaning.",
