              "index": 6,
              "count": 10,
              "title": "Three.js — The Visual Contract Made Direct",
              "narration": "A-Frame is superseded by a direct Three.js canvas providing full control: force-directed layout, tier-scaled geometry, sentiment aura rings, animated story beat transitions. Each node type maps to a geometry; each sentiment to an aura color. The visual contract makes the ontology concrete — a type that renders as a fallback primitive is visually anonymous. The renderer becomes an enforcement point, not just a display layer.",
              "tension": "high",
              "accent": "#27ae60",
              "docTitle": "kaaroViewer: A Self-Governing Spatial Intelligence Platform",
