              "title": "The Three-Part Lock — Ontology Made Defensible",
              "narration": "The three-part lock crystallizes: validator (canonical VALID_TYPES/VALID_RELS — 38 types, 29 rels), SOP reference (semantic + visual explanation), renderer (geometry/style switches) — all three must update atomically. The Dream Loop runs its first execution: the `reveals` relationship, repeatedly used from memory, is promoted from warning to blocking error. Across 4 Alone-Time runs, the library moves from 3 degraded entries to 9 ok · 0 watch · 0 degraded. The personalized ontology has its first defensible form.",
