              "title": "Two Paths — Explore and Enforce",
              "narration": "The explore pipeline offers anyone a draft knowledge graph in seconds — Gemini, a single LLM call, approximate ontology adherence. The visualize skill offers a power user a library-grade brief — three-pass encoding, full validator enforcement, permanent registration. The distinction is not quality alone: it is how much of the personalized ontology is enforced. Both paths produce intelligence briefs; only one enforces the full ontology contract.",
