              "title": "Painting — Images for At-a-Glance Comprehension",
              "narration": "The paint system adds a comprehension channel that geometry cannot provide. PaintContext assembles three inputs — spatial positioning (nodes in camera frustum), textual context (slide narration + node description), cinematic camera angle — into a prompt informed by stable diffusion seed prompt patterns. 4 named strategies (cinematic/documentary/abstract/blueprint) produce genuinely different images from the same canvas state. Gemini generates the image; Three.js applies it as a mesh texture.",
